===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|military rank}} {{lb|en|military ranks}} The holder of a senior military title, originally designating the commander of an army and now a specific rank falling under [[field marshal]] (in the British army) and below [[general of the army]] or [[general of the air force]] in the US army and air forces. {{defdate|from 16th c.}}
#: {{ux|en|'''General''' {{w|Dwight Eisenhower|Eisenhower}} was the first [[SACEUR]].}}
# {{senseid|en|strategist}} A great [[strategist]] or [[tactician]]. {{defdate|from 16th c.}}
#: {{ux|en|Hannibal was one of the greatest '''generals''' of the ancient world.}}
# {{lb|en|now|rare}} A general fact or proposition; a [[generality]]. {{defdate|from 16th c.}}
#: {{ux|en|We have dealt with the '''generals'''; now let us turn to the particulars.}}
# {{lb|en|Christianity}} The head of certain [[religious order]]s, especially [[Dominican]]s or [[Jesuit]]s. {{defdate|from 16th c.}}
# {{lb|en|xiangqi}} The [[equivalent]] of a [[king]] in [[Chinese chess]], the [[xiangqi]] [[piece]] that is [[confine]]d to the [[palace]], [[move]]s [[orthogonally]] one [[point]] at a [[time]], and whose [[loss]] [[decide]]s the [[game]].
# {{lb|en|nautical|obsolete}} {{synonym of|en|admiral}}{{ngd|, a [[senior]] [[naval]] [[title]], a [[great]] [[naval]] [[strategist]] or [[tactician]].}} {{defdate|16th|18th c.}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial|now|historical}} {{short for|en|[[general]] [[servant]]}}{{ngd|, a [[maid-of-all-work]], a [[servant]] [[able]] to be [[assign]]ed to any [[task]] in a [[household]].}} {{defdate|from 19th c.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1899|author=E. Nesbit|title=[[s:The Story of the Treasure Seekers/Chapter 1|The Story of the Treasure Seekers]]|passage=Then the servants left and there was only one, a '''General'''. A great deal of your comfort and happiness depends on having a good '''General'''.}}
#* {{RQ:West Return of the Soldier|edition=US|page=18|passage=My '''general''' is sister to your second housemaid.}}
# {{lb|en|countable}} {{short for|en|general election}}{{ngd|, a [[regular]] [[election]] for [[most]] [[office]]s in a [[region]] or [[country]].}}
#: {{ux|en|Sure, this [[candidate]] is the favorite in the [[primary]] among the [[party]] faithful, but how is he going to do in the '''general'''?}}
# {{lb|en|countable}} {{short for|en|general anesthetic}}{{ngd|, a [[substance]] [[use]]d to [[numb]] [[most]] [[feeling]] throughout the [[body]].}}
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} {{short for|en|general anesthesia}}{{ngd|, the [[category]] of [[substance]]s [[use]]d to [[numb]] [[most]] [[feeling]] throughout the [[body]] or an [[instance]] of [[such]] [[substance]]s.}}
